    "   random_state=1099);\n",
    "4. search max_depth in [3, 5, 8, None], min_samples_leaf in [1, 5, 15],\n",
    "   and ccp_alpha in [0.0, 0.0005, 0.001, 0.005];\n",
    "5. score with balanced_accuracy;\n",
    "6. fit only on the training data;\n",
    "7. print the best parameters and cross-validated score;\n",
    "8. evaluate the selected model once on X_test and print the same metrics\n",
